Dear Committee Secretariat,

I write to notify the Committee that Judicial Review proceedings have been =
issued and served in the matter Zahmoul v Secretary of State for Justice & H=
MCTS (AC-2025-LON-004293).

The claim raises concerns relating to:

=E2=80=A2 failures to identify or record the needs of a disabled court user;
=E2=80=A2 the absence of appropriate participation measures, contrary to the Equa=
lity Act 2010; and
=E2=80=A2 systemic administrative issues within HMCTS that contributed to clinica=
l deterioration.

These equality-related matters sit alongside allegations concerning the mis=
administration of court-controlled electronic material with potential crimin=
al relevance.

Given the Committee=E2=80=99s remit in relation to equality law and protections f=
or disabled individuals, I provide this notification for transparency.

A public archive of officially filed documents is available at:
https://github.com/nadiazahmoul/JR-Zahmoul-v-SSJ-HMCTS-Archive

Yours faithfully,
Nadia Zahmoul

